      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-a-mobile-app-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does a mobile app cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Price</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="mzx mzf2"><div class="mzlbd p"><div><span>MVP</span><i style="--w:30%"></i><b>RM18,000</b></div><div><span>Growth</span><i style="--w:58%"></i><b>RM35,000</b></div><div><span>Full Scale</span><i style="--w:100%"></i><b>RM60,000</b></div></div><small class="mzfn">One-time development · store accounts, hosting and licences separate</small></div></div></div><p>It is a one-time development budget. MVP is from RM18,000 for one platform with a standard UI kit, basic search and filtering, store submission help and a 30-day bug warranty. Growth is from RM35,000 for iOS and Android with custom UI/UX, a payment gateway or WhatsApp API, analytics and crash reporting, full store setup and 60-day support. Full Scale is from RM60,000 with a design system, offline mode and background sync, real-time updates or live tracking, role permissions and audit logs, a dedicated staging app and a 90-day priority SLA.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-who-puts-it-on-the-app-store-and-google-play"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Who puts it on the App Store and Google Play?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Store release</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-send"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="mzx mzf3"><div class="mzvs h"><span class="d"><i><svg class="mztk" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></i>Your store accounts</span><span class="d"><i><svg class="mztk" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></i>Listing and screenshots</span><span class="d"><i><svg class="mztk" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></i>Submitted</span><span class="mzrd"><i><svg class="mztk" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></i><span class="mzsw "><span class="a">In review</span><span class="b">Live</span></span></span></div><small class="mzfn">We prepare and submit. Apple and Google decide approval.</small></div></div></div><p>We do. MVP includes store submission help and Growth and Full Scale include full store setup. The store accounts are in your company’s name and paid separately. Approval is controlled by Apple and Google, so we can’t promise a review date, but we handle any changes they ask for.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-it-take-payments-or-send-whatsapp-messages"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can it take payments or send WhatsApp messages?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Payment</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="mzx mzf4"><div class="mzpay2"><i><svg class="mztk" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></i><span class="mzin"><b>Paid RM13.90</b><small>FPX · order A27</small></span></div><div class="mzwa"><span class="mzlg">K</span><span class="mzbub"><b>Kopi Kawan</b>Order A27 confirmed. Pick up at Bangsar, 10:15.</span></div></div></div></div><p>Yes, from the Growth package, which includes a payment gateway or the WhatsApp API, plus analytics and crash reporting. Payment gateway and WhatsApp fees are paid to those providers.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-does-it-work-offline"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Does it work offline?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Offline</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="mzx mzf5"><div class="mzoff"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg><span><b><span class="mzsw "><span class="a">You’re offline</span><span class="b">Back online</span></span></b><small><span class="mzsw "><span class="a">2 orders saved on this phone</span><span class="b">2 orders sent</span></span></small></span></div><div class="mzit "><span class="mzth"><svg class="mzpi" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M3.5 11.5l3-3 2 2 1.5-1.5 2.5 2.5"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="6" r="1"/></svg></span><span class="mzin"><b>Oat latte ×2</b><small>Saved 10:03</small></span></div><div class="mzit "><span class="mzth"><svg class="mzpi" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M3.5 11.5l3-3 2 2 1.5-1.5 2.5 2.5"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="6" r="1"/></svg></span><span class="mzin"><b>Kaya toast</b><small>Saved 10:04</small></span></div></div></div></div><p>With Full Scale, yes: the app keeps working without signal, saves what people do and syncs it in the background when they are back online. Full Scale also covers real-time updates such as live tracking. MVP and Growth need a connection.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-is-not-included"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What is not included?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Not included</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="mzx mzf6"><div class="mzft s"><div><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><b>Store accounts</b><em class="mzc ">Separate</em></div><div><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>Hosting</b><em class="mzc ">Separate</em></div><div><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><b>Licences</b><em class="mzc ">Separate</em></div><div><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-team"/></svg></i><b>Ongoing support</b><em class="mzc ">Separate</em></div></div></div></div></div><p>Store accounts, hosting, licences and ongoing support after the included period are separate. They are listed in your quotation so you know the running costs before we start.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-after-launch"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens after launch?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>After launch</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="mzx mzf7"><div class="mzlbd p"><div><span>MVP</span><i style="--w:33%"></i><b>30 days</b></div><div><span>Growth</span><i style="--w:66%"></i><b>60 days</b></div><div><span>Full Scale</span><i style="--w:100%"></i><b>90 days</b></div></div><small class="mzfn">Then System care from RM399 a month, if you want it</small></div></div></div><p>MVP has a 30-day bug warranty, Growth 60 days of support and Full Scale a 90-day priority SLA. After that, System care keeps the app running: System Care is RM399 a month, System Care Plus RM999 and System Priority RM1,999, with 1.5, 5 or 10 support hours.</p></div></div></article>
